{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"香港旅へお正月休みにいきました。\nwithスイカメンバー\n(七瀬,優里,純奈,かりん,私の仲良し組のこと)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/07/9483539/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し前から計画していて\nかりんちゃんに助けられつつの旅"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/07/9483539/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/07/9483539/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(この私服は母に作ってもらったセーラー。デザインは私.."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/07/9483539/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん歩きました。\n足痛い～～といいながらも\nたくさん観光したいのでいろんな地へ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たかった夜景を見れて\n(とても綺麗でした！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/07/9483539/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"THE香港感のあるお土産を買ったり\n(凄く古いボタンを沢山購入。服作りに使う用に。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカメン1番の目的、\n香港ディズニーで遊んだり\n(大好きなジェラトーニに会えた◎グリーティングいっぱいできて大満足◎)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お粥たべたり(とてもボリューム満点だった)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/07/9483539/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"火鍋たべたり(火鍋がまさかの日式だった笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋割りジャンケンしたり\n(にゃー(七瀬の事にゃーって呼んでる)と二人部屋だった)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女人街やスニーカー街を歩いたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エッグタルト食べたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/07/9483539/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"香港は、\nネオンの大きな看板が沢山街中にあって\nキラキラしててすごく好きな感じでした。\n一人看板に大興奮しました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな国に行きたいな～～\n一人海外にも挑戦したいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/07/9483539/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"❤︎\n新年早々良き思い出作れました～～！\nお仕事でも来たいな～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"満足"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/01/07/9483539/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}